.TH start-cli-server-set-nut-client 1  "client "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-server\-set\-nut\-client \- Monitor a UPS served by another NUT server
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli server set\-nut client\fR [\fB\-\-port\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIUPS_NAME\fR> <\fIHOST\fR> <\fIMONITOR_USERNAME\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Monitor a UPS served by another NUT server
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-port\fR \fI<PORT>\fR [default: 3493]
NUT server port
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIUPS_NAME\fR>
UPS name on the NUT server
.TP
<\fIHOST\fR>
NUT server hostname or IP address
.TP
<\fIMONITOR_USERNAME\fR>
Username for monitoring the remote UPS
